msgstr "The certificate has not been issued yet. Check that the signatory name and publisher name are set in the plugin settings; it is issued automatically afterwards."

msgid "plugins.generic.bijphgrPublicationCertificate.dash.next.noRecipient"
msgstr "No corresponding author is set on this article. Open the article, set a contact on the publication, then use Resend e-mail."

